<title>UK: T&amp;N in Indian venture with Goetze, Teikoku.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N in Indian venture with Goetze, Teikoku.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering company T&amp;N Plc said on Monday it was forming a joint venture with Goetze (India) Ltd and Teikoku Piston Ring of Japan to manufacture piston rings in India.</p>
<p>The venture will make nitrided and chromium plated stainless steel compression and oil rings, T&amp;N said.  </p>
<p>The main customers for the products will be car engines manufacturers and makers of low emission four stroke motorcycle engines.</p>
<p>The new factory of the joint venture will be based in India's southern city of Bangalore with production scheduled to start in 1998.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
